# Testcase 16 — Performance / throughput
# Covers: REQ-11
#
# Direct runs are dispatched to tc16-performance.sh before this manifest is
# loaded. See ../TC-16.md for staged generation/UDP/dedup/verification.
#
# The staged runner terminates with a delivery verdict and owns its stack.
# Batch runs use the shared UDP calibration with headroom; standalone runs
# default to 30,000 EPS. Throughput has no fixed pass threshold.
# Existing TC-16 data requires an explicit reset.

TC_TITLE="Performance / throughput test"
TC_UDP_CALIBRATION=1
TC_RUNNER=tc16-performance.sh
TC_COVERS="11"
TC_PROFILES=""

UPSTREAM_A_CONFIG=/airgap/config/upstream-perf.properties
DOWNSTREAM_CONFIG=/airgap/config/downstream-perf.properties
